team 1 1
wanderers off
map flat 200 160
# the yard, open on the north (x 99..102)
wall 94 74 5 1
wall 103 74 5 1
wall 94 87 14 1
wall 94 75 1 12
wall 107 75 1 12
# the outer wall (a 4-cell corridor), gates on the west (z 79..82) and the south (x 99..102)
wall 89 69 24 1
